---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ObfuscatedEmail from '../components/ObfuscatedEmail.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Affiliate Disclosure & Commercial Transparency | Is It Special?"
  description="Full affiliate disclosure and commercial transparency statement for Is It Special, detailing our participation in the Amazon Associates Program."
  translationUrl="/hi/affiliate-disclosure"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-20">
    <header class="space-y-3 pb-8 border-b border-[#dce5dd]/80 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#15803d] bg-[#eaf5eb] border border-[#bbf7d0]">
        <span>⚖️</span>
        <span>FTC & Amazon Associates Compliance</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#14241c] tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Affiliate Disclosure & Transparency
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#14241c]/60">
        Last updated: October 2026 • Strict Editorial Independence Policy
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-stone prose-base sm:prose-lg max-w-none pt-8
      prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-[#14241c]
      prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:text-[#14241c]/80 prose-li:text-[#14241c]/80">
      
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#eaf5eb] border border-[#bbf7d0] text-[#14241c] font-medium text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
        <strong>Official Amazon Associates Statement:</strong><br />
        <em>"As an Amazon Associate, Is It Special? (isitspecial.com) earns from qualifying purchases."</em>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Our Editorial Independence Covenant</h2>
      <p>
        At <strong>Is It Special?</strong> (https://www.isitspecial.com), our singular mission is to serve as an unvarnished consumer filter against corporate hype, viral TikTok illusions, and predatory consumer marketing.
      </p>
      <p>
        To preserve 100% intellectual honesty, our editorial evaluation and scoring process is completely insulated from commercial relationships:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No Sponsored Reviews:</strong> We never accept payment, free review samples with strings attached, or corporate sponsorships to review any product.</li>
        <li><strong>No Pay-to-Play Rankings:</strong> Manufacturers cannot pay to improve their Special Index score or change an "Overhyped" verdict to a "Masterpiece."</li>
        <li><strong>Independent Purchases:</strong> Whenever possible, our testing team buys items anonymously at retail price through standard consumer channels.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
      <p>
        Some of the product links on isitspecial.com are affiliate links. When you click one of these links and purchase an item on a retailer's website (such as Amazon), we may receive a small referral commission directly from the merchant.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>This referral commission comes at absolutely zero additional cost to you.</strong> You pay the exact same price whether you use our link or navigate to the retailer independently.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Retailer Programs</h2>
      <p>
        isitspecial.com is a participant in the <strong>Amazon Services LLC Associates Program</strong> and the <strong>Amazon Associates India Program</strong>, affiliate advertising programs designed to provide a means for websites to earn advertising fees by linking to Amazon.com, Amazon.in, and affiliated sites.
      </p>

      <h2>4. How We Choose Products</h2>
      <p>
        Products are selected for testing based on viral cultural prominence, reader recommendations, engineering curiosities, or bold manufacturer marketing claims. We frequently tear down and heavily criticize viral products that would otherwise generate large affiliate commissions if we simply praised them. If a product fails our laboratory benchmarks, we explicitly tell you to save your money.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Questions and Concerns</h2>
      <p>
        We believe transparency is the foundation of trust. If you have any questions regarding our affiliate relationships, editorial integrity, or testing methodologies, please contact our editorial desk directly at <ObfuscatedEmail user="editorial" domain="isitspecial.com" />.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
